Cast a net of static electricity in a radius of [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] for [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

Enemies standing in the net will take [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Lightning damage and be slowed by [31%, 35%, 38%, 40%, 41% (TL1-5; MP 100)].

When you move through the net, a static charge will accumulate on your weapon which will add [29, 39, 46, 53, 59 (TL1-5; MP 100)] additional Lightning damage to your next attack for each turn you spend within its area.

These effects scale with your Mindpower.
